    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control massive armies in this fun new RTS unlike any other.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New RTS Engine built from the ground up to have crazy features not seen in other RTSes !</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully supported matchmaking, ladder, replays, map editor, and chat channels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supported on Windows and Linux</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique (and dynamic)  Terran Types and features unseen in traditional RTSes !</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Water:</strong> Units are slowed when walking over water</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lava:</strong> Units are damaged when walking over lava</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Zone:</strong> Units for current Player are sped up</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glow Terrain:</strong> Speed Increase and Health Regen</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pacifist Terrain:</strong> Units are unable to attack when on Pacifist Terrain</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forbidden Zone:</strong> Units instantly die when touched</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Snow/Mud Terrain Styles:</strong> Tracks enemies movements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many, many, more..</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight while riding Turtles / Jeeps / RoboDogs !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560940/extras/0e97fba7a83f423864272d653cd57efe.avif?t=1755196836\" data-has-big width=800 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Includes map editor!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to use map editor to make your own melee maps, and share with friends!</p></li></ul>",
